sis": "one_script_draft"}, "publication_status": "requires_operator_review", "text": "素材事实（逐字引用）\n[reading-1] 校园读书周提供书单分享、读书打卡和读后感交流。活动地点与具体日期待运营确认。\n[reading-2] 参与者可分享一本推荐书及理由；不承诺奖品或参与人数。\n\n创意草稿（待运营审核）\n交付形式：精简文案\n以下标题、正文或分镜均为创意建议；新增事实、渠道和参与规则须运营确认。\n校园读书周：分享一本你推荐的书\n校园读书周来了：书单分享、读书打卡、读后感交流，等你加入。分享一本你推荐的书和理由，就能找到同路人。地点与日期请关注后续通知。\n\n运营建议（待确认，不属于已确认活动规则）\n活动地点与具体日期待运营确认\n投放渠道待运营确认\n不承诺奖品与参与人数，如需新增须重新规划估价\n本次报价仅涵盖所列单份脚本草稿；新增物料须另行规划估价，不包含实际拍摄、设计或投放。"}, "kind": "script", "request_id": "real-tool-failure-20261028T063333Z-0896d2", "source_ids": ["reading-1", "reading-2"], "validity": "valid"}, "rounds_used": 5, "spent_total": "3.00", "status": "success", "steps": [{"artifact_ids": ["reading-1", "reading-2"], "candidate_revision": null, "depends_on": [], "kind": "search_materials", "reusable": true, "status": "succeeded", "step_id": "step_fe14d140070d4418905f6153467a2d66"}, {"artifact_ids": [], "candidate_revision": 1, "depends_on": ["step_fe14d140070d4418905f6153467a2d66"], "kind": "estimate_cost", "reusable": false, "status": "succeeded", "step_id": "step_9e064e3897144a799b67c64872eb639b"}, {"artifact_ids": [], "candidate_revision": 1, "depends_on": ["step_fe14d140070d4418905f6153467a2d66", "step_9e064e3897144a799b67c64872eb639b"], "kind": "generate_script", "reusable": false, "status": "failed", "step_id": "step_f97fd64f676f41f28afab7932b8c0a7b"}, {"artifact_ids": [], "candidate_revision": 2, "depends_on": ["step_fe14d140070d4418905f6153467a2d66"], "kind": "estimate_cost", "reusable": true, "status": "succeeded", "step_id": "step_e197d5f50bb24373a375e1ef69710d99"}, {"artifact_ids": ["script_60e60322e39b48e4aa7f3d5db09b6caf"], "candidate_revision": 2, "depends_on": ["step_fe14d140070d4418905f6153467a2d66", "step_e197d5f50bb24373a375e1ef69710d99"], "kind": "generate_script", "reusable": true, "status": "succeeded", "step_id": "step_d953f7120e7b44cf9e7ccee68bfd744b"}], "violations": []}, {"action": "estimate_cost", "artifact_ids": [], "budget_gap": "0.00", "candidate_id"